<view class="page"><view class="topbar"><text class="topbar-back" bindtap="back">‹</text>电脑试玩棋谱</view><view class="page-inner"><view class="card">试玩已结束，此处查看保存的棋谱。正式电脑对局从新局开始。</view><view wx:if="{{state == 'loading'}}">正在读取棋谱…</view><view wx:elif="{{state == 'error'}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><block wx:else><view>{{note}}</view><chess-board board="{{board}}" show-node-labels="{{true}}" /><view class="record-controls"><button disabled="{{index == 0}}" bindtap="previous">上一手</button><button disabled="{{index == max}}" bindtap="next">下一手</button></view><slider wx:if="{{max}}" min="0" max="{{max}}" value="{{index}}" step="1" show-value="{{true}}" bindchange="jump" /></block><button class="gold-btn" bindtap="startAi">新开正式入门电脑局</button></view></view>
